In here, it will show how to use the Mutanter

Loader:
LoadModule allow using the name or table of names of the module u want to get the object itself
example:
Loader.LoadModule("Mutanter.py"), it will return a table [Mutanter.py, ... (more if table)]
LoadFromPath allow using the path of a file to get all modules/script from the file 

Get the reference of the folder and then contain it as table
Loader.LoadFromPath(FoldersTable) -> return found modules as table

